          {
            "title": "Naming",
            "id": 88828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Analogamente alla denominazione di variabili e funzioni, esistono alcune pratiche comuni per la definizione delle classi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher = Person(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Person</code>, seguito da <code>Person</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Segui le pratiche comuni per denominare le classi, proprio come fai con variabili e funzioni.</p><p>Definisci la classe <code>Person</code>, quindi usala per creare un insegnante.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher = Person(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"self\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>class</code>, seguito da <code>Person</code> e infine <code>Person</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Class name",
            "id": 89046,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I nomi delle classi di solito hanno la prima lettera maiuscola e le altre minuscole, come nel caso di <code>Person</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.age = age\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>Person</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Descriptive",
            "id": 88823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come per le variabili, cerchiamo di dare alle classi nomi descrittivi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, author, title)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.author = author\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.title = title\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"B\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>class</code>, seguito da <code>Book</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli nomi descrittivi per le classi, proprio come fai per le variabili.</p><p>Inizia una classe chiamata <code>Book</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, author, title)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.author = author\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.title = title\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"author\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>class</code>, seguito da <code>Book</code> e infine <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Consistent",
            "id": 89048,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come per la denominazione di variabili e funzioni, dovremmo dare nomi coerenti alle cose e fare attenzione alle maiuscole.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayHello\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayBye\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bye&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher = Person(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher.sayBye()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"206\" endIndex=\"212\" /><option startIndex=\"212\" endIndex=\"213\" /><option startIndex=\"213\" endIndex=\"214\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Saybye\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bye\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>sayBye</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assegna nomi coerenti a classi e metodi e fai attenzione alle maiuscole, proprio come con variabili e funzioni.</p><p>Fai in modo che il codice stampi <code>Bye</code> chiamando il metodo corretto su <code>teacher</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayHello\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayBye\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bye&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher = Person(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher.sayBye()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"198\" endIndex=\"205\" /><option startIndex=\"206\" endIndex=\"212\" /><option startIndex=\"212\" endIndex=\"213\" /><option startIndex=\"213\" endIndex=\"214\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Person\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sayHello\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bye\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>teacher</code>, seguito da <code>sayBye</code>, <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Other features",
            "id": 88771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come i metodi al di fuori delle classi, puoi usare le funzioni integrate e le funzionalità fondamentali di Python.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, flavor, ingredients)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.flavor = flavor\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.ingredients = ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print_ingredients\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" self.ingredients:    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applePie = Pie(\" /><text value=\"'apple'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", [\" /><text value=\"'flour'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'eggs'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'apples'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'butter'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applePie.print_ingredients()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"153\" /><option startIndex=\"154\" endIndex=\"155\" /><option startIndex=\"156\" endIndex=\"158\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"flour\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"eggs\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apples\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"butter\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>i</code> e infine <code>in</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come i metodi al di fuori delle classi, puoi usare le funzioni integrate e le funzionalità fondamentali di Python.</p><p>All'interno di un metodo, un'istanza accede ai propri dati tramite <code>self</code>.</p><p>Esegui un ciclo sugli ingredienti della torta affinché il codice li stampi uno per uno.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, flavor, ingredients)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.flavor = flavor\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.ingredients = ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print_ingredients\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" self.ingredients:    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applePie = Pie(\" /><text value=\"'apple'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", [\" /><text value=\"'flour'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'eggs'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'apples'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'butter'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applePie.print_ingredients()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"153\" /><option startIndex=\"159\" endIndex=\"175\" /><option startIndex=\"187\" endIndex=\"192\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display_ingredients\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"self.flavor\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"flour\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"eggs\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apples\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"butter\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print_ingredients</code>, seguito da <code>for</code>, <code>self.ingredients</code> e infine <code>print</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 88796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"Person():\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, age, height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.height = height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jess = Person(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(jess.age)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Manca la parola chiave <code>class</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è niente di sbagliato in questo codice</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Manca la parola chiave <code>class</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La definizione di una classe inizia con la parola chiave <code>class</code>, seguita dal nome e da due punti.</p><p>La prima riga è <code>Person():</code>. Cosa bisogna correggere prima che il codice possa definire <code>Person</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"Person():\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, age, height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.height = height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jess = Person(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(jess.age)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiungere la parola chiave <code>class</code> mancante e usare un'intestazione di classe</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nulla, perché le sole parentesi definiscono una classe</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Passare <code>self</code> quando si chiama <code>Person(29, 5)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Spostare <code>print(jess.age)</code> all'interno della definizione della classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiungere la parola chiave <code>class</code> mancante e usare un'intestazione di classe.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 88794,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con quanti valori possiamo chiamare il costruttore <code>Person</code> senza modificare la classe fornita?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, age, height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.height = height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jess = Person(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(jess.age)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"29\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">3</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere 2.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Python fornisce automaticamente <code>self</code> quando crei un'istanza.</p><p>Se modifichi la chiamata in <code>Person(29)</code>, perché genererà un errore?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, age, height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.height = height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jess = Person(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(jess.age)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"29\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fornisce age, ma lascia height senza un valore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fornisce self, ma lascia age e height senza valori</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fornisce height, ma lascia age senza un valore</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Richiede un valore per Person prima di age e height</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fornisce age, ma lascia height senza un valore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 88795,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali funzionalità del linguaggio Python possiamo usare all'interno di una classe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tutte le funzionalità fondamentali del linguaggio Python</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Per ora possiamo solo creare variabili</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tutte le funzionalità fondamentali del linguaggio Python.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno di una classe possiamo usare tutte le funzionalità principali del linguaggio Python.</p><p>Un metodo di classe deve usare un ciclo e un'istruzione <code>if</code> per elaborare un elenco. Questa struttura è consentita?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sì, i metodi possono usare queste funzionalità principali di Python</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No, una classe può contenere variabili ma nessun flusso di controllo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">No, i cicli sono consentiti solo fuori dalle definizioni delle classi</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Sì, ma solo se il ciclo e la condizione sono scritti fuori dal metodo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sì, i metodi possono usare queste funzionalità principali di Python.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 88792,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale tra queste non è una buona pratica per assegnare nomi alle classi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Assegnare alle tue classi nomi corrispondenti a parole chiave riservate del linguaggio come <code>if</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Scrivere in maiuscolo la prima lettera del nome di una classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assegnare alle tue classi nomi corrispondenti a parole chiave riservate del linguaggio come <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I nomi delle classi iniziano in genere con una maiuscola e non possono essere parole chiave riservate di Python.</p><p>Uno sviluppatore propone di chiamare una classe <code>if</code>. Perché questo nome dovrebbe essere rifiutato?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>if</code> è una parola chiave riservata del linguaggio</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ogni nome di classe deve contenere un trattino basso</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Python consente solo i nomi dei tipi integrati per le classi</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">I nomi di classe in minuscolo causano sempre errori di sintassi, anche quando non sono parole chiave</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>if</code> è una parola chiave riservata del linguaggio.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 89488,
